{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春王正月，公會齊侯于濼。公與夫人姜氏遂如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"公何以不言及夫人？夫人外也。夫人外者何？內辭也，其實夫人外公也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"二、夏四月丙子，公薨于齊。丁酉，公之喪至自齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"三、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月己丑，葬我君桓公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_29_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_29","textTraditional":"賊未討，何以書葬？讎在外也。讎在外則何以書葬？君子辭也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}